$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Indoor";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Sirius" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Cloudy" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> both have nothing to say to one and another. Both plan on a massive attack to take control of the others massive base. Tis a dangerous time for not only the war going on, but now one of their center foot grounds have fallen, leaving a wide area to cross, that if missed, they would plundge to their deaths. May the best Tribe prove Victorious!!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Map By:<f4> Lisa W. (LadyShar).... Find all my maps at http://welcome.to/LadyShars";